      "type": {
        "id": 14,
        "name": "Antwort BR / Büro"
      },
      "value": "<span><p><span>Zwischen 2020 und 2024 startete die Laufzeit von 13’919 Verträgen/Bestellungen im Beratungsbereich. Die Aufteilung nach Departement und Jahr ist in der folgenden Tabelle ersichtlich:</span></p><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><strong><span>Departement</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>2020</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>2021</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>2022</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>2023</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>2024</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>Gesamtergebnis</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>PARL, BR, BK</span></p></td><td><p><span>28</span></p></td><td><p><span>32</span></p></td><td><p><span>38</span></p></td><td><p><span>34</span></p></td><td><p><span>29</span></p></td><td><p><span>161</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>EDA</span></p></td><td><p><span>480</span></p></td><td><p><span>514</span></p></td><td><p><span>480</span></p></td><td><p><span>447</span></p></td><td><p><span>375</span></p></td><td><p><span>2 296</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>EDI</span></p></td><td><p><span>511</span></p></td><td><p><span>427</span></p></td><td><p><span>388</span></p></td><td><p><span>390</span></p></td><td><p><span>287</span></p></td><td><p><span>2 003</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>EFD</span></p></td><td><p><span>128</span></p></td><td><p><span>135</span></p></td><td><p><span>113</span></p></td><td><p><span>141</span></p></td><td><p><span>122</span></p></td><td><p><span>639</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>EJPD</span></p></td><td><p><span>115</span></p></td><td><p><span>130</span></p></td><td><p><span>144</span></p></td><td><p><span>139</span></p></td><td><p><span>133</span></p></td><td><p><span>661</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>UVEK</span></p></td><td><p><span>702</span></p></td><td><p><span>720</span></p></td><td><p><span>723</span></p></td><td><p><span>631</span></p></td><td><p><span>571</span></p></td><td><p><span>3 347</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>VBS</span></p></td><td><p><span>536</span></p></td><td><p><span>567</span></p></td><td><p><span>615</span></p></td><td><p><span>673</span></p></td><td><p><span>574</span></p></td><td><p><span>2 965</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>WBF</span></p></td><td><p><span>379</span></p></td><td><p><span>393</span></p></td><td><p><span>354</span></p></td><td><p><span>352</span></p></td><td><p><span>369</span></p></td><td><p><span>1 847</span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong><span>Gesamtergebnis</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>2 879</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>2 918</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>2 855</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>2 807</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>2 460</span></strong></p></td><td><p><strong><span>13 919</span></strong></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong><span>&nbsp;</span></strong></p><p><span>Ergänzende Informationen über die Datenbasis der Verträge / Bestellungen entnehmen Sie aus den Reporting Sets über das Beschaffungscontrolling (</span><a href=\"http://www.bkb.admin.ch\"><u>www.bkb.admin.ch</u></a><span> &gt; Berichterstattung &gt; Reporting Set Beschaffungscontrolling Bundesverwaltung). </span></p></span>"
    },
    {
      "type": {
        "id": 5,
        "name": "Eingereichter Text"
      },
